TEXT -440 840 Left 2 ;Saturation current: Bpk/K1_factor. Bbk is 2700Gauss and K1_factor is 41.7 (33.3 for L7)
TEXT -224 -440 Left 2 ;The 007NL transformer (just barely) can work with a 20V input voltage.\nThe 006NL transformer needs close to 30V input to function.\n \nSince the 007NL is a unicorn as far as the distributors are concerned\n(only Mouser seem to have it), I'll work with the 006NL and increase\nthe input voltage to 30V.\n \nThis decision doesn't seem to impact the netlist, just (a bunch of)\ncomponent values.
TEXT 232 608 Left 2 ;It seems that light loads actually result in really high input currents.\nI don't quite understand that.
